    {
      "text": "Because it's not. It's very clear if you saw it. The majority of Quls (\u0642\u064f\u0644\u0652) meaning \"say.\" Qul (\u0642\u064f\u0644\u0652) means \"say.\" The majority of Quls (\u0642\u064f\u0644\u0652) in the Quran are not for the prophet Muhammad.",
