        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[73:1]  O you cloaked one. [73:2]  Meditate during the night, except rarely. [73:3]  Half of it, or a little less.",
      "start": 3723.71,
      "end": 3769.59,
      "speaker": "Catherine",
