    {
      "text": "The name of this Sura is Cloaked. A cloak or a cover can be a protection for us against weather,",
      "start": 4278.01,
      "end": 4282.81,
      "speaker": "Catherine",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " The",
          "start": 4278.01,
