          "end": 4744.99,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " That's",
          "start": 4744.99,
          "end": 4744.99,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Happiness is devotion to God. Happiness is submission to God.",
      "start": 4744.99,
      "end": 4744.99,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " objection.",
