          "start": 4744.99,
          "end": 4744.99,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 4744.99,
          "end": 4744.99,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " submission",
          "start": 4744.99,
          "end": 4744.99,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 4744.99,
          "end": 4744.99,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And the opposite of that, of that is objection. If you are sad, you're objecting to what God is doing.",
      "start": 4744.99,
      "end": 4744.99,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " God.",
          "start": 4744.99,
