          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": " what",
          "start": 4744.99,
          "end": 4744.99,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": " will",
          "start": 4744.99,
          "end": 4744.99,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Those... and for the, for the reminder, that this world is an illusion, this life is temporary play.",
