        },
        {
          "word": " temporary",
          "start": 4744.99,
          "end": 4744.99,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And it's all set up just... God is so Merciful to give us another chance when we blew it the first time.",
